# {{id}}

A Maktaba plugin made with `mkp new rust` (Epic 54). It runs in maktaba-plugind's sandbox:
no network, no files, only the plugin API calls its manifest asks for and the admin grants.

```sh
rustup target add wasm32-wasip2
cargo build --release --target wasm32-wasip2
cp target/wasm32-wasip2/release/{{crate}}.wasm package/plugin.wasm
mkp check package                              # the home's validation and import audit
mkp test package --stage hello                 # run it in the harness
mkp pack package {{id}}.mkplugin               # the file to install (Settings, Plugins)
```

`mkp test --fixtures api.json` answers the plugin API from a file:
`{"library/video": {"id": "v1", "title": "A film"}}` (each key is `interface/function`).
